OL,3,ASales of baby sleeping bag halted by   
OL,4,ANext after new mum raises alarm        
OL,6,FNext says its own-brand, 2.5 tog pink  
OL,7,Ffloral sleep bag with removable sleeves
OL,8,Fthat comes in three sizes, has been    
OL,9,Fremoved from the website and stores and
OL,10,Fa product recall is under way.         
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
