OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACalls for consent defence change after 
OL,4,AJoanne Young rape case                 
OL,6,FThe trial has sparked calls for the    
OL,7,Fgovernment to ensure defendants cannot 
OL,8,Fuse "third-party consent" as a defence 
OL,9,Fin rape trials.                        
OL,11,FDaughter Alex Young said: "It has been 
OL,12,F23 years since this was last updated.  
OL,13,FSociety has progressed, crime has      
OL,14,Fprogressed. So why hasn't the law      
OL,15,Fprogressed with it?"                   
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
